  1816	than zero. A <code>task_board.launched</code> event MUST repeat the winning
  1817	creation lease and the Session Record's provider/launch mode; a mismatch is
  1818	<code>integrity_failure</code>. Audit event issuance and retention are specified
  1819	in Sections 10.7 and 18.4. A <code>tombstone.resolved</code> resurrection
  1820	requires a non-null resulting entry digest; every other resolution requires
  1821	null.
