-// TestRev11RecordConsumptionCensus is the call-graph gate for the
-// record-consumption table: every record the shared profile owner
-// consumes must pass its semantic admission owner before its bytes
-// are derived. It parses the shipped lease.go and requires that the
-// resume path calls the shared referenced admission owner, that the
-// owner calls the shared persistence and head helpers, that the
-// outer walk calls the resume derivation, and that admission runs
