+| Repository coverage | `go test ./... -cover` | 0 | `go-test-cover-rev12.log`; sessquery 86.5%, sessrepo 87.2%, sessstate 92.2%; all packages passed. |
+| Build | `go build ./...` | 0 | `go-build-rev12.log`. |
