+| 5.3/5.4 temporal authority | `checkReferencedCheckpointBinding` -> `checkReferencedCheckpointTemporal` -> `admitCheckpoint` | `TestReview11ReferencedTemporalAuthority`, `TestRev12ReferencedCheckpointLaterLease` | A referenced checkpoint owner must be at or before the consuming resume lease; its event heads must be in the resume predecessor closure. A later consumer may use an earlier checkpoint. Same-lease and historical controls remain valid. |
